    "detailed_description": "A new story in the critically-acclaimed STEINS;GATE series. From the depths of despair--explore a whole new world line. Your favorite characters return alongside a brand new cast!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>STEINS;GATE 0 continues the time travelling theme - but adds artificial intelligence as its central hook <br></li><li>Help a group of young students bend time to their will and prevent the onset of World War 3 <br></li><li>Beautiful artwork and engaging story for an unforgettable experience <br></li><li>Tells the story of an 'Alternate Worldline' - what happens if players failed the original story <br></li><li>Interact with the story using your smart phone - answering (or not!) your phone, and your responses, will determine the outcome to the story</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A new story in the critically-acclaimed STEINS;GATE series. From the depths of despair--explore a whole new world line. Your favorite characters return alongside a brand new cast!<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>STEINS;GATE 0 continues the time travelling theme - but adds artificial intelligence as its central hook <br></li><li>Help a group of young students bend time to their will and prevent the onset of World War 3 <br></li><li>Beautiful artwork and engaging story for an unforgettable experience <br></li><li>Tells the story of an 'Alternate Worldline' - what happens if players failed the original story <br></li><li>Interact with the story using your smart phone - answering (or not!) your phone, and your responses, will determine the outcome to the story</li></ul>",
